Both pass &local_20 to Setup_Flying_Objects as a 4-dword car-position vector;
Ghidra split the block into local_20 + uStack_1c/18/14 and gcc scatters them,
so the detached part spawned from a scrambled position (L2 cf135: all remaining
native-vs-wasm diffs were Flying_Objects entries). Scattered-locals class.

